WEBVTT

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:27.920
That damn temple!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.750
I thought peace had made them complacent,

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.220
but their military is formidable.

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:33.760
Sunda!

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.420
Don't give in, Clain!

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:42.100
You're a strong boy, aren't you?

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:43.730
Y-You sound like this is 
someone else's problem.

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:46.880
Nessa?!

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:57.830
Clain! What're you doing here?!

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:01.600
Phryne... Phryne is headed to the temple!

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:30.740
<i>Suteta hazu no fuan no tane ga 
kokoro tsukiyabutte me o dashita</i>

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:46.970
<i>Musuu no ibara ga kyou mo 
ashimoto nobite machikamaeteiru</i>

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:55.430
<i>Doko e yukeba aeru</i>

00:01:55.430 --> 00:02:10.320
<i>Dakishimenaide senaka no toge 
wa kimi o kizutsukeru yo</i>

00:02:10.320 --> 00:02:25.550
<i>Soredemo afureru omoi ga kimi o sagashiteiru</i>

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:35.050
"To the Temple"

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:53.800
I've been waiting for you, Phryne...

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:56.400
the world's beloved maiden...

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:59.950
Barrot, leave the room.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:00.570
But...

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:02.030
Leave the room.

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:15.650
Discuss things with the 
temple without fighting?

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:17.920
What a naïve thing to say!

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:19.480
I thought she was strange,

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:20.760
but she's really done it this time!

00:03:20.760 --> 00:03:22.970
This is normal for Phryne.

00:03:22.970 --> 00:03:26.970
She's doing it so that people in the Lost 
Millennium won't senselessly get hurt.

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:29.640
The temple's force is 
coming from the sea, too!

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:32.100
Turn the ship around! We'll...

00:03:32.100 --> 00:03:33.690
Murderers!

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:37.070
Not only are you killing others, 
but you're also killing yourselves!

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:38.940
Why do these pointless deaths have to...

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:41.480
Clain!

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.410
Clain... We're...

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:49.880
You're murderers...

00:03:51.010 --> 00:03:54.210
You're murderers, but you're my friends!

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:55.710
Clain...

00:03:55.710 --> 00:03:58.250
My first real friends...

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:00.710
I'm sure Phryne feels the same way, too.

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:04.010
That's why... she went there all by herself.

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:05.850
But I think it's wrong.

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:08.920
Since we're friends, it's wrong 
for her to go by herself!

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:11.430
That's why I wanna go with her, too!

00:04:11.430 --> 00:04:14.270
I see... So the key to the 
world went to the temple...

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:18.020
I heard everything, my dear friend.

00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:19.780
Dias!

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:23.030
I'll join Phryne and the boy there.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:26.820
We'll assist them so that they can 
have a discussion with the temple.

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:30.330
But this battle is now...

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:35.790
Yeah, it's hard to stop a 
battle once it's started.

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:39.040
But... don't worry.

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:40.750
We'll act as a decoy.

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.200
Mr. Dias!

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:45.030
Dias, what're you thinking?

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:45.720
What am I thinking?

00:04:46.730 --> 00:04:47.640
I'm thinking of love.

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:51.560
What can make up for the 
lost one thousand years?

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:56.300
Probably only the love to willingly 
sacrifice yourself for others.

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:58.190
Nessa's coming, too!

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:00.480
No! If you go to the temple,

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.070
that means both parts of 
the key will be there!

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:03.590
Clain!

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:07.820
Nessa, stay here.

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:08.950
I told you this before.

00:05:08.950 --> 00:05:11.280
If you go there, we'll lose everything...

00:05:11.280 --> 00:05:13.200
including Phryne's determination as well.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:16.370
Please, Nessa...

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.300
Okay, then...

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:24.210
Prepare a flying boat. I'll go with Clain.

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:25.470
Big Brother!

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:27.630
This isn't love. We just 
share a mutual interest.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:29.640
I want to be sure you get it right.

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.010
Yeah, of course.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:33.520
<i>Phryne...</i>

00:05:42.480 --> 00:05:44.630
Come here, Phryne.

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:46.840
Come close to me.

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:48.700
This battle is futile.

00:05:48.700 --> 00:05:52.560
Please stop attacking the 
Lost Millennium immediately.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:58.740
Of course, I do not wish to 
harm anyone in this world...

00:05:58.740 --> 00:06:02.240
unlike you, who's driven 
by her self-interest.

00:06:03.190 --> 00:06:07.150
However, that was in the 
past. I'll forgive you.

00:06:07.150 --> 00:06:09.690
So you've made your decision, Phryne...

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:15.560
to bring smiles to every window 
as the world's beloved maiden?

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:18.100
I will remain here.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.780
I will accept any pain.

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:23.270
But please let Nessa off the hook! She is...

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:25.530
Don't be ridiculous.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:27.660
Unless we have both of you,

00:06:27.660 --> 00:06:31.080
you cannot be the key to 
restart the Fractale Syst...

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:35.870
If you are not going to grant my wish...!

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:36.920
Phryne...

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:39.000
I...

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.960
I've come to realize...

00:06:45.210 --> 00:06:47.460
what I want to do...

00:06:51.010 --> 00:06:53.680
and what I want to protect!

00:06:54.520 --> 00:06:56.650
What you want to protect?

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:59.690
Unless you function as the key,

00:07:00.150 --> 00:07:03.000
even if we stop the battle, 
it'd be pointless.

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:08.290
People cannot live in a world 
where Fractale has collapsed.

00:07:08.290 --> 00:07:13.700
Those who you want to 
protect are not exceptions.

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:21.140
Hey! Protect the engine no matter what!

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:21.750
Yes, Sir!

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.550
Ha! You used to be a delicate boy.

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:26.210
You've changed quite a bit!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:29.130
I don't know if I've changed or not myself.

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.400
But I want to do something.

00:07:31.400 --> 00:07:33.120
I can't just stay put.

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:35.320
That's the L.M. spirit.

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:37.310
By each individual standing up,

00:07:37.310 --> 00:07:40.050
it becomes the power to resist the system.

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:42.440
I think it's a little different from that.

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.980
You, too, Sunda. I never 
thought you'd come with me.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:48.160
You've somehow changed a little.

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:53.830
It was me who gave you orders to 
protect Phryne and Nessa, so...

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:57.460
and the engine, too.

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:05.830
I see it!

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.630
It's the temple!

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:15.390
This isn't good!

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.000
We did it!

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:26.560
We're gonna dash in!

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:34.860
Phryne, you too are already 
aware of it, aren't you?

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:44.160
People cannot even think without Fractale.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:46.540
If we take Fractale away from them...

00:08:46.540 --> 00:08:49.670
But... by setting them free from 
it, they can, for the first time,

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:52.380
stand up on their own feet, can't they?!

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:54.420
You think so?

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:59.640
Perhaps people will only go astray 
when nightfall falls on Fractale.

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:03.140
But even if they go astray, they 
can hold each other's hand!

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:04.520
You think so?

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:09.570
Their arms are stretched out 
only in order to beg for alms.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:13.400
They just think they deserve it and 
they are completely accustomed to it.

00:09:13.840 --> 00:09:18.800
They are waiting... while 
looking up at the sky intently.

00:09:19.460 --> 00:09:22.370
If we take that away from them,

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:27.540
all that's left is a very sullen world.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.760
B-But...!

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.340
Data analysis complete.

00:09:41.340 --> 00:09:44.810
The intruders are Sunda 
Granites and Clain Decran.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:49.060
No, Clain! Don't come! If you come...

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:52.150
Nessa will come here, too?

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.980
Phryne, if you didn't decide to be the key,

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:58.300
why did you return to the temple?

00:09:58.300 --> 00:10:00.240
I wanted to end this battle...

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:03.330
It was me, the temple's 
Archpriestess, who gave the order

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.950
to purge the Lost Millennium.

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:09.370
You really thought that you could 
discuss and resolve the matter?

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:13.710
I still think I can, even now.

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:16.090
What is the source of that confidence?

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:19.930
As my mother... no, as my big sister,

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:22.970
I am sure that you can 
understand my feelings, so...

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:25.220
You and I were...

00:10:25.810 --> 00:10:30.270
You and I were the same Phryne before!

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:38.490
This way!

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:41.450
<i>Just wait, Phryne!</i>

00:10:47.360 --> 00:10:50.350
You were Phryne in the past, Sister.

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:53.300
Even if Fractale is restarted,

00:10:53.300 --> 00:10:58.720
this world needs to go through this 
all again within several centuries.

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:03.030
Unless a new key is created 
to restart the system,

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:05.600
the world of Fractale cannot be maintained.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:10.160
Each time, "we" have to be created anew,

00:11:10.160 --> 00:11:12.300
"we" will be experimented on to see if

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:13.860
"we" could become suitable for the key,

00:11:13.860 --> 00:11:14.690
and...

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:16.400
"we" will be defiled.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.440
I cannot stand it anymore!

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:21.820
"We" will get defiled over and over again!

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:26.280
I'm not going to let them 
kill any more of "us"!

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.820
Right, Sister?!

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:35.420
Come here, Phryne.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:38.540
Sister...

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:39.130
Come.

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:43.080
Sister...

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:08.290
You and I were the same Phryne?

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:09.550
You're wrong.

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:12.520
You're the world's beloved maiden.

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:14.250
And I am...

00:12:14.610 --> 00:12:17.500
the maiden who wasn't loved by the world!

00:12:20.100 --> 00:12:21.760
Intruders in the Jade block!

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:23.620
There seems to be some damage! 
Send soldiers immediately!

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:26.520
We'll head there to back them up! 
Report the details of the damage!

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:31.640
Dammit! We need more ammunition!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:31.640
Focus your fire on the starboard side!

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:33.250
Takamy! What're you doing?!

00:12:33.250 --> 00:12:33.850
Yes, Sir!

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:34.880
Say, Enri...

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.100
What is it?

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.800
Hey, what're you doing?!

00:12:36.670 --> 00:12:39.980
Will you be sad if Nessa disappears?

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:42.210
What? Nessa!

00:12:43.670 --> 00:12:45.200
Will you be sad?

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:46.070
You stupid head!

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:49.620
If you disappear?! You're 
always running off somewhere!

00:12:49.980 --> 00:12:51.960
Saying that you're playing hide-and-seek!

00:12:52.740 --> 00:12:54.210
Hide-and-seek...

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:56.790
Miss! We're receiving a 
communication from the Tristan!

00:12:58.110 --> 00:13:00.920
The Tristan will make an 
entry into the temple.

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.480
We request the Danan's cooperation.

00:13:02.480 --> 00:13:03.720
Wait! Make an entry?!

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:07.640
In five minutes, the temple's 
hangar will become wide open.

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:09.390
How can you make that happen?!

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:13.520
Let's go, Enri!

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:16.520
Nessa! What're you saying?! If you go...

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.860
Nessa is going!

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:20.230
Even if Nessa has to play 
hide-and-seek, Nessa is going!

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:21.740
Hey!

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:23.880
Wait!

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:27.270
You wanna see Clain that bad?

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:29.370
Nessa dislikes breaking promises.

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:29.990
What?

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:34.990
Clain, Phryne and Nessa promised 
to be together forever!

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:36.960
Nessa does not break her promises!

00:13:37.870 --> 00:13:39.530
M-Miss...

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:43.630
We'll join Alabaster. Takamy, 
turn the Danan around.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:46.300
What? Is it okay?

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:51.450
We can't just let you go by yourself, can we?

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:53.060
Enri!

00:13:54.560 --> 00:13:57.150
The world's beloved maiden...

00:13:57.150 --> 00:14:00.230
But to me, a hateful maiden.

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:04.570
You're trying to protect something 
you love for the people you love.

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:07.630
I envy you!

00:14:08.070 --> 00:14:09.490
But, Phryne...

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:15.330
Even if I have no one to love, 
I will protect this world!

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:17.540
Sister...

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:21.130
I will restart this world 
however many times it needs.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:25.680
People will gently die without knowing 
the real happiness of being alive...

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:30.740
without being able to find 
what's really important!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:37.800
That's right... just like me...

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:44.570
That's my revenge to this 
world that gave birth to me!

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:48.490
Archpriestess!

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:57.860
Hold it!

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.930
Prepare yourself for the worst, Clain.

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:14.650
What's going on?

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:20.360
The Lost Millennium hacked into our 
system and opened all the routes!

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:31.200
Do not go, Phryne!

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:36.120
I now understand your sadness!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:40.130
For your sake as well, I will...

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:44.130
A-Archpriestess?

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:47.400
My sadness...

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:53.920
Sad...? My...

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:01.640
The world's beloved maiden...

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:04.850
Enri?!

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.290
Dammit!

00:16:06.290 --> 00:16:07.860
Let Nessa go!

00:16:10.530 --> 00:16:11.860
Nessa?!

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:13.280
Big Brother... Clain!

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:15.490
Why are you guys here?!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:22.580
Help... Clain!

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:25.890
Nessa!!

00:16:25.890 --> 00:16:26.580
Clain!

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:40.700
Looks like we made it just in time.

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:42.640
Dias!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:45.900
Is that...

00:16:46.220 --> 00:16:49.340
Don't tell me you have a Fractale Terminal!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:52.180
What's with you?!

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:55.140
After you removed the terminals 
from those out-of-range refugees!

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:56.430
We can't help it.

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:59.370
Unfortunately, this is 
still a Fractale world.

00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:02.290
If we are to fight in enemy territory,

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.620
we have no chance of victory 
unless we imitate them.

00:17:05.040 --> 00:17:06.710
You bastard...

00:17:07.640 --> 00:17:08.790
Enri!

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:12.240
Did you shamelessly march in here 
by following what Alabaster said?!

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:13.550
That's...

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:15.510
It's not Enri's fault.

00:17:15.510 --> 00:17:17.890
Nessa came here to keep our promise.

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:18.930
What?

00:17:19.190 --> 00:17:22.470
Clain, you said we'd be together 
forever, didn’t you?

00:17:22.470 --> 00:17:26.690
Being together means sticking together 
and not letting go of each other.

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:28.690
B-But, Nessa, you are...

00:17:28.960 --> 00:17:31.410
You two should go find Phryne.

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:33.610
She should be lost somewhere.

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:37.040
Nessa, you can go to Phryne, right?

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:37.610
Yep!

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:39.320
Nessa...!

00:17:39.630 --> 00:17:41.910
She's wandering, seeking you two.

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:45.660
Let's go!

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:53.510
The mind key has just 
started moving. Follow her.

00:17:53.510 --> 00:17:54.840
She'll lead you to Phryne.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.590
Kill her as soon as you find her.

00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:00.640
We'll continue to destroy 
the temple's interio...

00:18:00.640 --> 00:18:01.950
You bastard!

00:18:02.920 --> 00:18:04.970
If we destroy the actual key,

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:07.280
they can't restart Fractale for now, right?

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:10.520
The morale of the temple 
will decrease greatly.

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:12.270
If we invade then...

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:14.820
Big Brother!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:17.780
Did you fall for her?

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.240
Wait, Big Brother!

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:26.870
<i>I'm rapidly losing the feeling of Nessa.</i>

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:28.670
<i>This is...</i>

00:18:29.060 --> 00:18:32.500
♪ If I am to offer... ♪

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:33.560
Nessa?

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:38.970
♪ A wish to the day star... ♪

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.050
That song...

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:38.970
<i>That's right! This song...</i>

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:44.430
<i>Both Phryne and Nessa sang this song 
when I met them for the first time.</i>

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:49.810
<i>This song was popular around the 
time Fractale was created long ago.</i>

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:51.700
Nessa...

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:00.660
Who are you people?

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:02.280
We've found the key. We'll destroy her now.

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:04.160
Wh-Why?

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:08.790
Miss Phryne, please go!

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:09.670
Priestesses...

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:10.750
Now, hurry!

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:27.580
♪ If I am to offer a 
wish to the day star ♪

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:31.190
♪ I would ask it to give me... ♪

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:31.190
Clain?! Nessa?!

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:32.510
Phryne!

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:38.920
Oh no... I can't hear you!

00:19:46.240 --> 00:19:47.290
Nessa...

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:54.020
Your voice... is reaching 
me... through Nessa.

00:19:54.020 --> 00:19:57.000
Clain, Nessa... I am...

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.840
Let's go back together, Phryne.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:00.970
Let's go back to that house.

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:03.340
Let's live together, the three of us.

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:05.580
You, Nessa, and me...

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:07.930
The three of us... forever!

00:20:12.220 --> 00:20:13.350
Archpriestess!

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:17.360
We've prepared Odin. Please get out of here!

00:20:17.360 --> 00:20:19.930
We will hold the "God Creation Ceremony."

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:22.580
Open the stairway to the 
summit of the heavens.

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:23.360
But...

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:27.620
Phryne?

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:32.820
All I wanted was for you to protect Nessa.

00:20:32.820 --> 00:20:34.040
What?

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.750
Only the memory from the 
time when I was beautiful...

00:20:37.060 --> 00:20:38.800
When you were beautiful?

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:40.340
What the heck are you talking about?!

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:45.760
Don't say such a sad thing, my sweet Phryne.

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.470
You are...!

00:20:48.720 --> 00:20:52.110
Your soul and body are beautiful.

00:20:52.680 --> 00:20:56.190
I know that more than anyone.

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:58.150
What're you doing?!

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:03.720
Poor him... We have to tell him, too...

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:10.860
that we're bound by abundant love.

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:13.300
Right, Phryne?
